30
00:02:06,935 --> 00:02:11,630
The four parts. Every gate has 100
points in four parts with fixed weights.

31
00:02:11,970 --> 00:02:16,666
Part 1, Concepts: 30 points. Six
written questions, 5 points each.

32
00:02:16,706 --> 00:02:22,406
Each requires a mechanism: which objects,
refs, files or rules are involved, and

33
00:02:22,446 --> 00:02:26,137
