Closed book, no terminal.

34
00:02:26,477 --> 00:02:30,456
Part 2, Prediction: 20 points.
Four items, 5 points each.

35
00:02:30,496 --> 00:02:35,955
You get the commands that built a state,
and you predict the output of further

36
00:02:35,995 --> 00:02:40,890
commands and the new state. No
terminal. Object IDs are not asked for.

37
00:02:41,230 --> 00:02:46,625
Part 3, Hands-on diagnosis: 30 points. A
repository that a script builds in a broken

38
00:02:46,665 --> 00:02:50,313
