39
00:02:50,353 --> 00:02:51,995
You work in the lab shell.

40
00:02:52,335 --> 00:02:58,170
Part 4, Oral interview: 20 points. Six
questions asked one at a time, each with a

41
00:02:58,210 --> 00:03:01,143
follow-up. Spoken, no terminal, no notes.

42
00:03:01,483 --> 00:03:07,590
The pass rule. The threshold of the gate
overall, 85 for this one, and at least 70

43
00:03:07,630 --> 00:03:13,588
percent in every part: 21 of 30 in Concepts,
14 of 20 in Prediction, 21 of 30 in

44
00:03:13,628 --> 00:03:19,435
Hands-on, 14 of 20 in Oral. A total above
