46
00:03:21,124 --> 00:03:24,250
How the gate is taken. One
sitting, parts in order.

47
00:03:24,290 --> 00:03:29,464
The gate file gives the time for each part.
Parts 1 and 2 are written on paper or in

48
00:03:29,504 --> 00:03:32,940
