Levels 3 to 5, before a third attempt.

82
00:05:57,900 --> 00:06:01,920
A picture helps. Think of the gate as
a driving test, not a written quiz.

83
00:06:01,960 --> 00:06:06,593
The written part checks that you know the
rules. The prediction part checks that you

84
00:06:06,633 --> 00:06:11,154
