87
00:06:19,170 --> 00:06:22,406
In a driving test, arriving at
the destination is not enough.

88
00:06:22,446 --> 00:06:26,755
If you ran a red light on the way, you
fail. That's the "safety of the path" row,

89
00:06:26,795 --> 00:06:29,762
