118
00:08:39,906 --> 00:08:41,554
Five mistakes to watch for.

119
00:08:41,894 --> 00:08:46,691
Opening the gate file "to see what is in
it". Root cause: treating the gate as study

120
00:08:46,731 --> 00:08:50,492
material; a gate that has been read
is a gate that has been taken.

121
00:08:50,832 --> 00:08:54,473
Reading generate.sh or check.sh
